{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001906","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001906"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001906","label":"析父（楚靈王問鼎答者）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"析父","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0060","c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0268"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0060","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p033","quote":"析父"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0268","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p033","quote":"析父"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"析父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001906","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0268","start":268,"end":270,"surface":"析父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001906","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p033","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p033","text":"十一年，伐徐以恐呉。靈王次於乾豀以待之。王曰：「齊、晉、魯、衞，其封皆受寶器，我獨不。今吾使使周求鼎以爲分，其予我乎？」析父對曰：「其予君王哉！昔我先王熊繹辟在荊山，蓽露藍蔞以處草莽，跋渉山林以事天子，唯是桃弧棘矢以共王事。齊，王舅也；晉及魯、衞，王母弟也：楚是以無分而彼皆有。周今與四國服事君王，將惟命是從，豈敢愛鼎？」靈王曰：「昔我皇祖伯父昆吾舊許是宅，今鄭人貪其田，不我予，今我求之，其予我乎？」對曰：「周不愛鼎，鄭安敢愛田？」靈王曰：「昔諸侯遠我而畏晉，今吾大城陳、蔡、不羹，賦皆千乘，諸侯畏我乎？」對曰：「畏哉！」靈王喜曰：「析父善言古事焉。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m033-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface